ption>警察局長夏爾瑪（Pradeep Sharma）說，偷拍犯是一名自動三輪車司機，目前正在接受偵訊，釐清動機。（X@RituRathaur）</figcaption></figure><p>欲請生理假！印大學女清潔工遭男主管被迫脫衣「拍衛生棉照」證明</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T03:20:23.468054+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2533,"images":20,"source":"HK01 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T03:00:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T13:38:59.388945+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T03:18:17.834634+00:00","content_hash":"b766591f50bc326e68a4aa4bf453fdf9b76191c1104940fe82f16961d1b5c8b6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}